Description: Clock and calendar flyout for the Xfce panel
 Shopno Calendar is a panel clock for Xfce with a calendar flyout, in
 the spirit of the Windows 11 clock.
 .
 The clock shows the time over the date, on one line, the time only, or a
 custom format, and updates exactly on the minute and straight after a
 resume, a clock change or a new time zone. Clicking it opens a calendar
 with the time, the full date and the month, which can be moved through
 by mouse, wheel and keyboard. It takes every color from the GTK theme.
